{
  "_comment": [
    "Default bindings for the four Duke pads this package declares. The face layout follows",
    "the Xbox controller: A lower-left, B lower-right, X upper-left, Y upper-right - mapped",
    "onto the same keyboard cluster every other core uses (X/Z/S/A) so hands do not relearn.",
    "White and Black ride the shoulder buttons on a modern pad, Q/W on the keyboard. The",
    "triggers are ANALOG axes; on the keyboard C and V press them fully, which is what a",
    "digital key can honestly do. Player 1 keeps the keyboard as well as the first pad;",
    "players 2 to 4 get a pad each and no keys."
  ],
